WEEK 4 — BUILDING THE REACT FRONTEND

Date: Monday, 31 August 2026

Problem: The catalog reloaded in a loop, and the Bag stayed empty after adding an item until the page was refreshed.

Solution:
- Found that the loader function was recreated on every render, so the effect ran again and again.
- Stored the loaded catalog in a ref and fetched it only when it was empty.
- Re-read the bag from the server on every tab switch, so the screen matches the server.
- Restarted Vite after installing packages to fix the "Outdated Optimize Dep" error.
- Checked the layout on phone and laptop widths.
